 the items you selected.Auto Buy All Items: Automatically purchases all available items in the shop.Egg Selection Dropdown: Choose specific eggs (Basic Egg, Forest Egg, Arctic Egg, Blooming Egg, etc.).Auto Buy Egg: Automatically purchases only the selected eggs.Auto Buy All Egg: Automatically buys all egg types available in the game.Custom Buy Amount: Input any custom egg purchase quantity (from 1 up to 500,000).Cost Calculator Display: Calculates and displays the total money cost for your selected eggs and bulk purchase multiplier in real-time.3. ⚙️ Misc Tab (Utilities &amp; Performance)FPS Limiter: Set custom FPS limits directly in-game (setfpscap).WalkSpeed Toggle &amp; Slider: Modify your character's movement speed (from 25 to 100). Resets to default (16) when disabled.Anti-AFK System: Automatically simulates clicks every 10 minutes to prevent Roblox from disconnecting you due to inactivity.4. 💾 Config &amp; UI SystemAuto Save &amp; Load Config: Automatically saves your toggles, selected items/eggs, sliders, and settings to a JSON file (RixHubScriptHatchAPet_Config.json).Clean &amp; Modern Draggable GUI: Includes tab navigation (Main, Shop, Misc) and a draggable open/close toggle button.Auto Cleanup: Automatically removes old versions of the GUI upon re-executing.Executor Compatibility✅ ALL OTHER EXECUTORS SUPPORTED!","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"https://key.zaroguard.com/DeltaScripts","owner":{"_id":"6a58bcebfd118704aa385a57","username":"DELTA_BRO","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9040ed6751deec568556f16dedbaadf23288ef915b589402367d86f1fdd39906.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a58bcebfd118704aa385a57-1788493555416.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6a58bcebfd118704aa385a57","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9040ed6751deec568556f16dedbaadf23288ef915b589402367d86f1fdd39906.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a58bcebfd118704aa